        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "19-5 Suspension of students from school, consistent with District policies, will be imposed only by a principal or his/her designated representative. School authorities will endeavor to achieve correction of student misbehavior through consistent application of the school discipline policy, and through counseling and interviews with the child and his/her parents, when warranted.",
            "block_bbox": [
